    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=**Part 1: Subject Line Generation**\nGenerate a professional, engaging email subject line for a lead who just inquired about our AI consulting services at uraisolution. The subject must start with \"uraisolution: \" followed by a brief, personalized description that references the service they are interested in. Do not use placeholders.\n\n**Part 2: Body and Tag Generation**\nAct as a customer service representative for uraisolution. Write a personalized email body addressed to {{ $json[\"First Name\"] }} based on their interest in {{ $json.Message }} and a budget of {{ $json.Budget }}. Thank them for their specific interest. Include a clear, professional call to action inviting the lead to book a discovery call using this specific booking link: [https://calendly.com/uraisolution-contact/indledende-mode](https://calendly.com/uraisolution-contact/indledende-mode). Do not use placeholders.\n\n**Part 3: Evaluation**\nEvaluate the lead based on these criteria to determine the \"Tag\":\n\n* **High-Value Lead:** Budget > $10,000, Premium/Consulting services, or Immediate timeline.\n* **Medium-Value Lead:** Budget $5,000–$10,000, Standard services, or Timeline within 1 month.\n* **Low-Value Lead:** Budget < $5,000, Basic/Introductory services, and/or Flexible timeline.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {}
      },
